ts the protagonist when she is trying to decide which cake to buy for her friend who is hospitalized for illness. She was wondering why he was always skipping work at the store."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c79615"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35f3b55c65c1377777cf52958f96011446e366acf1ad92a8d22230758dc6dfba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c6b529ef983c2970a81b607439772ff6a8b059df7ecf63848aed2d8cc1c2637.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p2596","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1163","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2596","name":"Studio-74","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:15380:1163","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2596","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2596","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2596","name":"Studio-74","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:41148:v15784","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
